        <p class="method-caption">The denominator is published bets plus recorded dropped bets in the rounds shown. Failed runs with no usable forecast, missing slots, and discarded correction attempts are outside these counts; failures remain in the underlying run records. The scored fraction describes how much data can be evaluated, not how often a model was right. Live and delayed-replay breakdowns use each model’s available rounds.</p>
